    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>A Rapid Recycler allows a Blaster Weapon that normally fires only in Single-Shot mode to act in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> mode. (This Upgrade is not available for Weapons that have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Splash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Splash\">Splash</a> radius, or Weapons that specifically prohibit it.) Switching between the two firing modes is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>. </p>",
